  "prefLabel": "En 1003.02 Interconnection Review",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1003.02 Interconnection Review. There shall be 3 interconnection review paths which are the simplified process, fast track process, and standard process. Within the simplified process and fast track process there shall be options to undertake supplemental review and an applicant options meeting prior to entering standard process. Any applicant may elect to be placed in standard process or to move into standard process during application processing. The utility shall process the applications in the order of their queue position as established pursuant to En 1004.03 unless the application is part of a group study pursuant to En 1012.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
